// Environment/property assumptions (fiat propositions), shared across branches
// through ordinary children references.

fiat disturbance_model_valid {
  ```
  The disturbance torque model (gravity gradient, aerodynamic, solar radiation pressure, residual magnetic moment) envelopes the disturbances actually acting in the target orbit ({$orbit_altitude})
  ```
}

fiat mass_properties_valid {
  ```
  The inertia tensor and mass properties used for control design deviate from the real vehicle within the control system's stability margins
  ```
  until: FM
  promote: bind
  reason: "promote to a veriq verification once the mass-properties test has measured the real vehicle"
}
